{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50767","headline":"喜闻收复河陇 · 张祜","name":"喜闻收复河陇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏书频降尽论边，将择英雄相卜贤。\n河陇已耕曾殁（陈九思同志疑当作「没」。\n）地，犬羊谁辩却朝天。\n高悬日月胡沙外，遥拜旌旗汉垒前。\n共感垂衣匡济力，华夷同见太平年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}